0 FILE 10156 - main.ldr
0 Promotional LEGO delivery truck (set 10156): a six-wheeled grey cab-over truck with opening doors, chrome grille and trim, exhaust pipes, air horns, a steerable front cab, windscreen, mudguards, and a LEGO-logo side sticker, accompanied by its cap-wearing driver minifig
